    },
    {
      "route_id": "mode_roleplay_game_turn",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/ext/mode_roleplay/game/turn",
      "auth": "user",
      "handler_capability": "http.handle",
      "timeout_ms": 30000,
      "max_concurrency": 8,
      "description": "游戏域通道（批 5 turn 服务类型框架）：玩家输入派发进绑定 RP 会话 {session_id, text, service=main|npc_chat|barks|event}——一期实开 main（chat.send_message 注入分支薄代理+background 即时回执，叙事经 data/messages 轮询回流）；npc_chat=mode.session 专属会话指引、barks/event 后置占位 400；会话绑定校验+单宿主租约（未 attach 409）"
    },
    {
      "route_id": "mode_roleplay_game_operation",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/ext/mode_roleplay/game/operation",
      "auth": "user",
      "handler_capability": "http.handle",
      "timeout_ms": 10000,
      "max_concurrency": 8,
      "description": "游戏域通道（世界内嵌批次二）：自由操作→结构化命令 {session_id, operation: {id, params}}——Propose（id 须在会话绑定包 operations 清单/params 按 params_schema 校验，fail-closed 400 带原因）→ Adjudicate（声明 effects 走 State Contract Validator 同源结算 state.adjudicate 服务，与 behaviors 同通道；玩家也是 Agent 同一校验，原子结算无部分应用）；回执 {applied: true, state_delta} 或 {applied: false, reason: 具体原因}（拒绝必须带原因）；会话校验+单宿主租约与 game/turn 同闸；审计 source=operation 沉淀回路自动可见"
    },
    {
